() Tj T*
(1 Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how supplier qualification is carried out at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all supplier qualification activities in production and quality control at Lakemoor \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Farid Lindqvist, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Inspect deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Confirm the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Clean the result against the acceptance criterion, and record the result on form F-143.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of supplier qualification are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
